-accordion-children" role="region" aria-labelledby="chatgpt-accordion-title" class="px-5 pb-3.5 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto cursor-default" data-component-part="accordion-content"><span data-as="p">The easiest path is the <a href="https://chatgpt.com/plugins/plugin_asdk_app_69fb9378663481919a68e8a2109644e5" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Parallel Search app in the ChatGPT app directory</a>. Open the listing, or search for “Parallel Search” at <a href="https://chatgpt.com/apps" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">chatgpt.com/apps</a>, and click Install. The steps below add the server as a custom connector instead.</span><span data-as="p"><strong>Warning:</strong> <a href="https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/developer-mode" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Developer Mode</a> must be enabled, and this feature may not be available to everyone. MCPs in ChatGPT are experimental and may not work reliably.</span><span data-as="p">First, go to Settings → Connectors → Advanced Settings, and turn on Developer Mode.</span><span data-as="p">Then, in connector settings, click Create and fill in one of the following. The free endpoint does not advertise OAuth, so pair it with <strong>No authentication</strong>:</span><div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent" data-has-floating-buttons="" numberOfLines="4" language="text"><div data-floating-buttons="true" class="absolute top-3 right-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 print:hidden"><div class="code-block-copy-button z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_1uaq9fpbb9qnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/copy-button [.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:b