</code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div><span data-as="p">Inside droid, type <code>/mcp</code> to open the interactive manager and verify the server is connected. For more details, see the <a href="https://docs.factory.ai/cli/configuration/mcp" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Factory MCP documentation</a>.</span></div></details><details class="accordion border-standard rounded-2xl mb-3 overflow-hidden bg-background-light dark:bg-codeblock cursor-default"><summary class="relative not-prose flex flex-row items-center content-center w-full cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:dark:bg-gray-800" aria-controls="pi-accordion-children" aria-expanded="false" data-component-part="accordion-button"><div id="pi" class="absolute top-[-8rem] [[data-banner-state=visible]_&amp;]:top-[-10.5rem]"></div><div class="flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center" data-component-part="accordion-caret-right"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0 text-gray-600 transition-transform duration-200 dark:text-gray-400 -rotate-90"><path d="M14.0238 4.00002H3.97576C3.33776 4.00002 2.74976 4.34702 2.44276 4.90602C2.13576 5.46502 2.15576 6.14802 2.49776 6.68702L7.52176 14.61C7.84476 15.119 8.39676 15.422 8.99976 15.422C9.60276 15.422 10.1548 15.118 10.4778 14.61L15.5028 6.68602C15.8438 6.14702 15.8648 5.46402 15.5578 4.90502C15.2508 4.34602 14.6628 3.99902 14.0248 3.99902L14.0238 4.00002Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div class="leading-tight text-left w-full min-w-0" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="accordion-title-container"><p id="pi-accordion-title" class="m-0 font-medium leading-6 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200" data-component-part="accordion-title">Pi</p></div></summary><div id="pi-accordion-children" role="region" aria-labelledby="pi-accordion-title" class="px-5 pb-3.5 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto cursor-default" data-component-part="accordion-content"><span data-as="p">Pi ships without built-in MCP support, so install the <a href="https://github.com/nicobailon/pi-mcp-adapter" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link"><code>pi-mcp-adapter</code></a> package first:</span><div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent" data-has-floating-buttons="" numberOfLines="1" language="shellscript"><div data-floating-buttons="true" class="absolute top-3 right-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 print:hidden"><div class="code-block-copy-button z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_v5apfpbb9qnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/copy-button [.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-100 dark:[.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-800" data-testid="copy-code-button" aria-label="Copy the contents from the code block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400 group-hover/copy-button:text-gray-500 dark:text-white/40 dark:group-hover/copy-button:text-white/60"><path d="M14.25 5.25H7.25C6.14543 5.25 5.25 6.14543 5.25 7.25V14.25C5.25 15.3546 6.14543 16.25 7.25 16.25H14.25C15.3546 16.25 16.25 15.3546 16.25 14.25V7.25C16.25 6.14543 15.3546 5.25 14.25 5.25Z" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejo