<span class="line"><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">}</span></span>
</code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div><span data-as="p">For higher rate limits, add a <code>headers</code> object with <code>&quot;Authorization&quot;: &quot;Bearer YOUR-PARALLEL-API-KEY&quot;</code> and a key from <a href="https://platform.parallel.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">platform.parallel.ai</a>. To sign in with OAuth instead, set <code>url</code> to <code>https://search.parallel.ai/mcp-oauth</code> and leave out the <code>Authorization</code> header. Zed then prompts you to authenticate in your browser.</span><span data-as="p">For more details, see the <a href="https://zed.dev/docs/ai/mcp" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Zed MCP documentation</a>.</span></div></details><details class="accordion border-standard rounded-2xl mb-3 overflow-hidden bg-background-light dark:bg-codeblock cursor-default"><summary class="relative not-prose flex flex-row items-center content-center w-full cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:dark:bg-gray-800" aria-controls="warp-accordion-children" aria-expanded="false" data-component-part="accordion-button"><div id="warp" class="absolute top-[-8rem] [[data-banner-state=visible]_&amp;]:top-[-10.5rem]"></div><div class="flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center" data-component-part="accordion-caret-right"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0 text-gray-600 transition-transform duration-200 dark:text-gray-400 -rotate-90"><path d="M14.0238 4.00002H3.97576C3.33776 4.00002 2.74976 4.34702 2.44276 4.90602C2.13576 5.46502 2.15576 6.14802 2.49776 6.68702L7.52176 14.61C7.84476 15.119 8.39676 15.422 8.99976 15.422C9.60276 15.422 10.1548 15.118 10.4778 14.