<span class="line"><span>Transport: HTTP</span></span>
<span class="line"><span>URL: https://search.parallel.ai/mcp</span></span>
<span class="line"><span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div><span data-as="p">For higher rate limits, add an HTTP header <code>Authorization: Bearer YOUR-PARALLEL-API-KEY</code> with a key from <a href="https://platform.parallel.ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">platform.parallel.ai</a>. To sign in with OAuth instead, set the URL to <code>https://search.parallel.ai/mcp-oauth</code> and keep the OAuth type on Dynamic. Raycast then prompts you to Sign In before the tools become available.</span><span data-as="p">For more details, see the <a href="https://manual.raycast.com/ai/model-context-protocol" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Raycast MCP documentation</a>.</span></div></details><details class="accordion border-standard rounded-2xl mb-3 overflow-hidden bg-background-light dark:bg-codeblock cursor-default"><summary class="relative not-prose flex flex-row items-center content-center w-full cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:dark:bg-gray-800" aria-controls="lm-studio-accordion-children" aria-expanded="false" data-component-part="accordion-button"><div id="lm-studio" class="absolute top-[-8rem] [[data-banner-state=visible]_&amp;]:top-[-10.5rem]"></div><div class="flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center" data-component-part="accordion-caret-right"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0 text-gray-600 transition-transform duration-200 dark:text-gray-400 -rotate-90"><path d="M14.0238 4.00002H3.97576C3.33776 4.00002 2.74976 4.34702 2.44276 4.90602C2.13576 5.46502 2.15576 6.14802 2.49776 6.68702L7.52176 14.61C7.84476 15.119 8.39676 15.422 8.99976 15.422C9.60276 15.422 10.1548 15.118 10.4778 14.61L15.5028 6.68602C15.8438 6.14702 15.8648 5.46402 15.5578 4.90502C15.2508 4.34602 14.6628 3.99902 14.0248 3.99902L14.0238 4.00002Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div class="leading-tight text-left w-full min-w-0" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="accordion-title-container"><p id="lm-studio-accordion-title" class="m-0 font-medium leading-6 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200" data-component-part="accordion-title">LM Studio</p></div></summary><div id="lm-studio-accordion-children" role="region" aria-labelledby="lm-studio-accordion-title" class="px-5 pb-3.5 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto cursor-default" data-component-part="accordion-content"><span data-as="p"><a href="lmstudio://add_mcp?name=Parallel%20Search%20MCP&amp;config=eyJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczovL3NlYXJjaC5wYXJhbGxlbC5haS9tY3AifQ%3D%3D" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Add to LM Studio</a> installs the server in one click.</span></div></details><details class="accordion border-standard rounded-2xl mb-3 overflow-hidden bg-background-light dark:bg-codeblock cursor-default"><summary class="relative not-prose flex flex-row items-center content-center w-full cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:dark:bg-gray-800" aria-controls="goose-accordion-children" aria-expanded="false" data-component-part="accordion-button"><div id="goose" class="absolute top-[-8rem] [[data-banner-state=visible]_&amp;]:top-[-10.5rem]"></div><div class="flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center" data-component-part="accordion-caret-right"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0 text-gray-600 transition-transform duration-200 dark:text-gray-400 -rotate-90"><path d="M14.0238 4.00002H3.97576C3.33776 4.00002 2.74976 4.34702 2.44276 4.90602C2.13576 5.46502 2.15576 6.14802 2.49776 6.68702L7.52176 14.61C7.84476 15.119 8.39676 15.422 8.99976 15.422C9.60276 15.422 10.1548 15.118 10.4778 14.61L15.5028 6.68602C15.8438 6.14702 15.8648 5.46402 15.5578 4.90502C15.2508 4.34602 14.6628 3.99902 14.0248 3.99902L14.0238 4.00002Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div class="leading-tight text-left w-full min-w-0" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="accordion-title-container"><p id="goose-accordion-title" class="m-0 font-medium leading-6 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200" data-component-part="accordion-title">Goose</p></div></summary><div id="goose-accordion-children" role="region" aria-labelledby="goose-accordion-title" class="px-5 pb-3.5 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto cursor-default" data-component-part="accordion-content"><span data-as="p"><a href="goose://extension?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsearch.parallel.ai%2Fmcp&amp;type=streamable_http&amp;timeout=300&amp;id=parallel-search-mcp&amp;name=Parallel%20Search%20MCP&amp;description=Parallel%20Search%20MCP%20server" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Add to Goose</a> installs the server in one click.</span></div></details></div>
<span data-as="p">If your client isn’t listed, most MCP clients accept the <code>mcpServers</code> format shown in the Cursor section. For clients that use a different wrapper (e.g., VS Code’s top-level <code>servers</code>, Windsurf’s <code>serverUrl</code>), check the client’s documentation for the correct field names.</span>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="best-practices"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#best-practices" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Best practices</span></h2>
<h3 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="filtering-by-date-domain-or-path"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#filtering-by-date-domain-or-path" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Filtering by date, domain, or path</span></h3>
<span data-as="p">For flexible date, domain, or path preferences, include the constraints directly in the search query or objective. This gives the model room to find relevant sources without unnecessarily excluding the rest of the web. For example:</span>
<ul>
<li>“Latest AI research papers from 2026”</li>
<li>“News about climate change from nytimes.com”</li>
<li>“Product announcements from apple.com in the last month”</li>
</ul>
<span data-as="p">If your authenticated deployment requires a hard constraint, pin <code>advanced_settings.source_policy.after_date</code>, <code>advanced_settings.source_policy.include_domains</code>, or <code>advanced_settings.source_policy.exclude_domains</code> using <a href="#configure-search-behavior" class="link">Search MCP overrides</a>. Because the configuration applies to every <code>web_search</code> call on that connection, reserve hard filters for requirements that should apply throughout the session.</span>
<div role="note" aria-label="Warning" class="callout my-4 px-5 py-4 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl flex gap-3 border border-yellow-200 bg-yellow-50 dark:border-yellow-900 dark:bg-yellow-600/20 [&amp;_[data-component-part=&#x27;callout-icon&#x27;]]:mt-px" data-callout-type="warning"><div class="mt-0.5 w-4" data-component-part="callout-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="flex-none size-5 text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300"><path d="M 9 6.75 v 1.5 m 0 3 h 0.0075 m -5.2035 3 h 10.392 c 1.155 0 1.8765 -1.2503 1.299 -2.25 L 10.299 3 c -0.5775 -0.9997 -2.0205 -0.9997 -2.598 0 L 2.505 12 c -0.5775 0.9997 0.144 2.25 1.299 2.25 z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div><div class="text-sm prose dark:prose-invert min-w-0 w-full [&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-light dark:[&amp;_kbd]:bg-background-dark [&amp;_code]:text-current! [&amp;_kbd]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:text-current! [&amp;_a]:border-current [&amp;_strong]:text-current! text-yellow-800 dark:text-yellow-300" data-component-part="callout-content"><span data-as="p">Source-policy fields are hard filters and can significantly reduce result quality. Prefer natural-language guidance unless your application must include or exclude specific domains or paths.</span></div></div>
<h2 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="troubleshooting"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#troubleshooting" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="min-w-0 break-words cursor-pointer">Troubleshooting</span></h2>
<h3 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="common-installation-issues"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#common-installation-issues" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">Common Installation Issues</span></h3>
<details class="accordion border-standard rounded-2xl mb-3 overflow-hidden bg-background-light dark:bg-codeblock cursor-default"><summary class="relative not-prose flex flex-row items-center content-center w-full cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden gap-3 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-gray-100 hover:dark:bg-gray-800" aria-controls="cline-authorization-error-redirect-uri-must-be-https-accordion-children" aria-expanded="false" data-component-part="accordion-button"><div id="cline-authorization-error-redirect-uri-must-be-https" class="absolute top-[-8rem] [[data-banner-state=visible]_&amp;]:top-[-10.5rem]"></div><div class="flex size-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center" data-component-part="accordion-caret-right"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0 text-gray-600 transition-transform duration-200 dark:text-gray-400 -rotate-90"><path d="M14.0238 4.00002H3.97576C3.33776 4.00002 2.74976 4.34702 2.44276 4.90602C2.13576 5.46502 2.15576 6.14802 2.49776 6.68702L7.52176 14.61C7.84476 15.119 8.39676 15.422 8.99976 15.422C9.60276 15.422 10.1548 15.118 10.4778 14.61L15.5028 6.68602C15.8438 6.14702 15.8648 5.46402 15.5578 4.90502C15.2508 4.34602 14.6628 3.99902 14.0248 3.99902L14.0238 4.00002Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><div class="leading-tight text-left w-full min-w-0" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="accordion-title-container"><p id="cline-authorization-error-redirect-uri-must-be-https-accordion-title" class="m-0 font-medium leading-6 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200" data-component-part="accordion-title">Cline: &#x27;Authorization Error redirect_uri must be https&#x27;</p></div></summary><div id="cline-authorization-error-redirect-uri-must-be-https-accordion-children" role="region" aria-labelledby="cline-authorization-error-redirect-uri-must-be-https-accordion-title" class="px-5 pb-3.5 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-x-auto cursor-default" data-component-part="accordion-content"><span data-as="p">This error occurs when Cline attempts OAuth authentication but the redirect URI isn’t using HTTPS. The Search MCP at <code>/mcp</code> is free and doesn’t require OAuth in the first place — wrap it in <code>mcp-remote</code> so Cline treats it as a plain stdio server:</span><div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent" data-has-floating-buttons="" numberOfLines="12" language="json"><div data-floating-buttons="true" class="absolute top-3 right-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 print:hidden"><div class="code-block-copy-button z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_fjbkpbb9qnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/copy-button [.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-100 dark:[.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-800" data-testid="copy-code-button" aria-label="Copy the contents from the code block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400 group-hover/copy-button:text-gray-500 dark:text-white/40 dark:group-hover/copy-button:text-white/60"><path d="M14.25 5.25H7.25C6.14543 5.25 5.25 6.14543 5.25 7.25V14.25C5.25 15.3546 6.14543 16.25 7.25 16.25H14.25C15.3546 16.25 16.25 15.3546 16.25 14.25V7.25C16.25 6.14543 15.3546 5.25 14.25 5.25Z" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M2.80103 11.998L1.77203 5.07397C1.61003 3.98097 2.36403 2.96397 3.45603 2.80197L10.38 1.77297C11.313 1.63397